The only effect levitation has on movement rates is to increase
carrying capacity to maximum, so making it easier to avoid the
encumbrance penalties; riding a strong steed will have the same
effect, but they don't stack.

(Other than the Plane of Air, where levitation doesn't increase
movement rate as such, but eliminates the movement penalties there.)

